# Track the hand-authored eval wiki pages (.wiki/wiki/ — the synthesis + typed graph
# the eval walks), but ignore everything else under .wiki/: the bulky raw book texts,
# the copied template scaffold, and any local qmd/obsidian state. Rebuild raw/ + the
# qmd index from corpus.md.
.wiki/*
!.wiki/wiki/
.wiki/wiki/.obsidian/

# Per-run retrieval result dumps — regenerable; recorded numbers live in BASELINE.md.
results-*.json
results-*.jsonl

# structure-recovery probe scratch (throwaway flat/struct book copies + collections)
.probe/

# breadcrumb/structure 3-arm test: regenerable per-run dumps (fixture is committed)
probe3-emit.jsonl
probe3-results.json
probe3-authored.json
